// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// BETTER IMMERSION FOR BALDUR'S GATE - BG0800 CREATURES
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Halfling Commoner — static, known-good halfling dialogue setup.
COPY_EXISTING ~HALFG3.CRE~ ~override/BGBG0801.CRE~
